<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: I’m Falkner, Violet City\nBlock Boss! Bird Man of the East Side!\rPeople say you can clip a bird homie’s\nwings with a lil taser...\rI won’t let NOBODY disrespect my\nbirds! They my FAMILY! I named ’em!\rI’ma show you what real pigeon power\nlook like!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: ...Nah. NAH.\nMy pops’ precious birds...\rHe gon’ disown me. AGAIN.\rAight, an L is an L. Take this\nofficial Big League Chain.\fThis the Zephyr Chain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Zephyr Chain from Falkner!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: With that Chain, homies up\nto Lv. 20, even traded ones,\fwill listen to you, no questions.\rIt also let you use the hidden\nmove Smash n Grab outside of\fbattle, whenever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: Use a TM and a homie\nlearn a new move on the spot.\rThink before you use it--a TM\nonly work once.\rTM51 is Crash Pad.\nIt heal up half the max HP.\rThere’s blocks in the cities and\ntowns up ahead. Run ’em all!\rAs for where you go next...\fI’d hit up Azalea Town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: There’s Blocks in every city\nup ahead. Go test yourself.\rNext I’d hit Azalea Town.\rI’ma train so hard I become the\ngreatest Pigeon Guy who ever lived.\fThat’s a real job. I checked.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future Kingpin!\nYou here for Falkner, right?\rYou welcome here! ...Kinda.\rThere’s a tower called Sprout Tower\nwhere Hustlers go get humbled by\fbald dudes in robes.\rRunnin’ up on Falkner WITHOUT that?\nThat’s crazy. Ha ha ha!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, future Kingpin! I ain’t a Hustler,\nbut I give advice for free!\fI got no qualifications!\rYou believe in yourself?\nThen listen up.\rGrass types get cooked by Flyin’\ntypes. Pigeons beat salad. Science.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard scrap! Keep that up and you’ll\nbe Kingpin before my rent due!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City Block\nNo Birdseed Past This Point</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City Block\rBlock Boss: Falkner\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
